a={'schema':'numeric_shared_payload_low_rank_v1_audit','result_sha256':hashlib.sha256(RESULT.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'runner_sha256':hashlib.sha256(RUN.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'checks':checks,'all_checks_pass':all(checks.values()),'recomputed_execution':{'forwards':6,'sequences':recomputed,'fit_native':fit_endpoints,'fit_capture':fit_endpoints,'fit_patched':fit_e,'test_native':test_endpoints,'test_capture':test_endpoints,'test_patched':test_e},'finding':'Scientific terminal and exact evidence are valid. observed_sequences undercounts by 160 because run_stage returns capture endpoints plus patched rows but omits the separate native_logits endpoints; preregistered and actual total are 736.'}
